From 6d9437989a96f6149968b1b92d125d24a1419a2e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sipho Mkwananzi <sipho.mkwa@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 13:29:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Complete homepage/interior page audit fixes and contact form

- Fix Button component: all CTAs now use real hrefs (Navbar, MobileMenu,
  Hero, LeadershipPreview, CTA) instead of dead no-op buttons
- Resolve leadership title inconsistency: standardize on "Director of
  Technology & Engineering" across config, homepage, and leadership/contact
  pages; align bios accordingly
- Add Federal Readiness to navigation and sitemap (was previously orphaned)
- Populate config/capabilities.ts and config/social.ts; refactor
  Capabilities section and capabilities page to use shared config instead
  of duplicated data
- Align theme.css color tokens with design-system/Colors.md
  (Federal Navy #0F2747, Mission Blue #2563EB, gold/slate/success added)
- Wire up Space Grotesk (headings) and Inter (body) via next/font/google
  per design-system/Typography.md
- Build real contact form: React Hook Form + Zod validation, honeypot
  spam field, POSTs to /api/contact which sends via Resend
  (falls back to server-side logging if RESEND_API_KEY is unset)
- Add footer social icons (LinkedIn/X/GitHub) using custom SocialIcons
  component, since installed lucide-react version no longer ships
  trademarked brand icons
- Fix ESLint unescaped-entity errors in contact and industries pages

npm run build and npm run lint both pass clean.
